---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Print & POD Platform — Spatialytics"
  description="SaaS tools that help local print shops offer modern print-on-demand services and compete with large platforms."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <a href="/solutions" class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-medium hover:underline mb-4 inline-block">← All Solutions</a>
        <p class="text-amber-400 font-medium mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Print & POD</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
          Modern POD tools for local print shops
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Large online platforms dominate print-on-demand. Local shops have the production capacity and relationships — they just need software that lets them compete without giving up control or margin.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">What the platform covers</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Product catalog and dynamic pricing</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Order intake and status tracking</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Customer-facing storefronts</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Production and fulfillment workflows</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Local production as the competitive edge</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Why it matters here</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Keeps print revenue and jobs in the region</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Helps shops offer the same modern experience customers expect</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Reduces reliance on distant platforms</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Creates a software product line with real local demand</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card border-amber-500/20 mb-12">
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          This is one of the core product directions for Spatialytics. We’re building the foundation that lets local print businesses participate fully in the on-demand economy — without becoming just another fulfillment node for someone else’s platform.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Talk about POD for your shop</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
